{"sourceUrl":"https://www.xxmu.edu.cn/hlxy/info/1070/3270.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:27.870620+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://www.xxmu.edu.cn/hlxy/info/1070/3270.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>为激发护理学类大学生的科研兴趣，培养创新思维与实践能力，助力优秀本科生提升科研素养，以及增进护理类专业大学生对河南医药大学护理学院的了解，河南医药大学护理学院拟定于</span></span><span>2025年</span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span>6</span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>举办本科生科</span></span><span><span>研</span></span><span><span>夏令</span></span><span><span>营</span></span><span><span>活动</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>本届夏令营活动由河南医药大学护理学教师全程伴学，将</span></span><span><span>开展科研创新</span></span><span><span>专题</span></span><span><span>培训和</span></span><span><span>研究生科研经验交流等一系列活动，激发学生们的科研兴趣，提升科研综合素养，</span></span><span><span>为优秀本科生提供参加科研</span></span><span><span>学术活动</span></span><span><span>的机会。</span></span><span><span>具体</span></span><span><span>安排如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>申请对象条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>拥护党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.在校护理学类</span></span><span><span>本科生。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>在</span></span><span><span>校期</span></span><span><span>间</span></span><span><span>成绩优异，已在学术期刊上发表论文或获得</span></span><span><span>大学生创新创业训练项目立项</span></span><span><span>者优先</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4</span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>对科研有浓厚兴趣，有潜在的科学研究能力，有志于继续攻读研究生或从事学术研究工作，在科技创新研究方面有突出表现的学生优先。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5</span></span><span>.</span><span><span>数量</span></span><span>30-50</span><span><span>名全国在校护理学类</span></span><span><span>本科生</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、报名材料和方法</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span></span><span>.申请人提交材料</span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>1）</span></span><span><span>附件</span>1《</span><span><span>河南医药大学</span></span><span><span>护理学院</span>2025年本科生科</span><span><span>研</span></span><span><span>夏令</span></span><span><span>营</span></span><span><span>申请表》；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>2）</span></span><span><span>附件</span>2《</span><span><span>河南医药大学</span></span><span><span>护理学院</span>2025年本科生科</span><span><span>研</span></span><span><span>夏令</span></span><span><span>营</span></span><span><span>报名信息汇总表》；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span>3）申请同学请将所有附件以<span>“</span><span>姓名+学</span></span><span><span>校</span><span>+</span></span><span><span>夏令</span></span><span><span>营</span></span><span><span>材料</span></span><span><span>名称</span></span><span><span>”</span><span>重命名，于</span></span><span>2025年7月30日</span><span><span>12</span></span><span>:00前将附件1</span><span><span>和</span></span><span><span>附件</span>2</span><span><span>以</span></span><span><span>压缩包</span></span><span><span>形式</span></span><span><span>发送至</span>xxmuhl</span><span><span>xy@163.com。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.录取与通知</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>我院将根据报名情况和择优原则，确定入选</span></span><span><span>学</span></span><span><span>员名单</span></span><span><span>，并</span></span><span><span>于</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span>5</span><span><span>年</span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span>3日前</span><span><span>于</span><span>“新医护理”微信公众号公示获得学员资格的名单，未获学员资格者不再另行通知</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、夏令营日程安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span><span>开营时间：</span><span>202</span></span><span>4</span><span><span>年</span><span>8月</span></span><span>6</span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.地点：河南医药大学护理学院会议室+线上</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>活动内容：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>1）开营仪式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>2）教师讲授科研经验</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>3）学员分享科研成果，教师点评</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>4）闭营总结和颁发参营证书</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四、注意事项</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>科研夏令营活动不收取参营费用，但学员必须按要求全程参与夏令营的各项活动，上下午分别签到和签退。如果申请者确认参加后又由于个人原因不能参加夏令营活动，请务必于</span><span>8</span></span><span><span>月</span>5日之前</span><span><span>告知夏令营负责人</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>以梦为马，不期而遇。欢迎优秀的你参加河南医药大学护理学院</span><span>2</span></span><span>025</span><span><span>年护理学类本科生科研夏令营活动，我们在这里期待与你相遇</span></span><span>!</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span>河南医药大学护理学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2025年7月7日</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"ff13aa417df64e71762c648fdabe26eb45baf4184a76656f1d1943396d446554","textLength":909,"sourceSha256":"509dbfb2643e82f7c834c8cf23bda05fed786685dae8e6d383531695de1ecf0f","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件1：河南医药大学护理学院2025年本科生科技夏令营申请表.docx","url":"https://www.xxmu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1518227713&wbfileid=11983395"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-d17210cf6ef2d6075272","title":"2025年河南医药大学护理学院关于开展2025年本科生科研夏令营的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:27.870620+00:00"}
